# What `docker build` sends: only what Cargo needs to build the server (crates/server/Dockerfile).
# Everything else, the frontend, target/ and any local secrets among it, stays behind.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!src-tauri/Cargo.toml
!src-tauri/build.rs
!src-tauri/src/

# Never, even inside what is let through above.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/*.local
**/.env
**/.env.*
